---
/**
 * Dark-only theme, per the ramose.ai brand guide: warm white on near-black,
 * with graphite panels and orange as the one signal. Overrides Starlight's
 * ThemeProvider so no OS/localStorage preference can flip the site to a
 * light palette.
 */
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = "dark";
</script>
